+/* Supplement only: current generated lcos-tokens.css stays untouched.
+ * Live Figma nFUdroLvI5qJZuYTW8h2rF variable values, 2026-09-20.
+ * 2:28589 / 2:28588 / 23:11520 / 23:11521 / 23:12848 / 5:7913.
